  "interpretation": "M3B_DOES_NOT_EARN_GENERAL_ADVANCEMENT — adequate governed PIT coverage exists, but Y2 worsens numerically in both validation seasons and clearly worsens realized role-loss. Y3 shows a statistically detectable but practically near-zero improvement (~0.00033 MAE) with near-zero fitted coefficients and no supporting development-era gain. Because horizon-specific M3b was not predeclared and evidence is not replicated across Y2/Y3 as a meaningful effect, do not preserve it as an independent candidate signal for M4/M5.",
